# Worktrees

Every plan uses a git worktree. **Never** use the `EnterWorktree` tool.

```
git worktree add .worktrees/<feature-name> -b <feature-name>
```

Edit files in that worktree. Clean up: `git worktree remove .worktrees/<feature-name>`

# Before finishing

- Run `npm run typecheck` after code changes
- After mobile changes: `npx -y react-doctor@latest .` from `apps/mobile/` — fix all warnings except icon-related ones; refactor to `useReducer` if warned about too many state calls

# Coding

- TypeScript strict — avoid `any`
- Follow existing patterns; shared types go in `packages/types/`
- Mobile styling: NativeWind (Tailwind on RN components)
- Dependencies in the specific app/package, not the root
- Backend: validate before DB ops; throw `ConvexError` for client errors
- Never edit `.env` files

# Protected

Do not modify: `*.proto`, `.env*`, `.claude/settings.json`

Do not change `apps/mobile/package.json` → `"main": "expo-router/entry"`
